     other:

               (a, b] = tx P R : a ă x ď bu           [a, b) = tx P R : a ď x ă bu

   We sometimes also need unbounded intervals

                    [a, 8) = tx P R : a ď xu             (a, 8) = tx P R : a ă xu
           (´8, b] = tx P R : x ď bu        (´8, b) = tx P R : x ă bu

    These unbounded intervals do not include “˘8”, so that end of the interval is
    always open12.




