Let us go back to the “days of the week” function example that we worked on above, we
can define the domain, codomain and range:

  • The domain, A, is the set of days of the week.

  • The codomain, B, is the 26 letters of the alphabet.

  • The range is the set tF, M, T, S, Wu — no other elements of B are images of inputs
     from A.

