1.3 Ĳ The Limit of a Function

    Before we come to definitions, let us start with a little notation for limits.

        Notation 1.3.1.

     We will often write

                                      lim f (x) = L
                                     xÑa

       which should be read as

           The limit of f (x) as x approaches a is L.




