         = lomonf (a) +( f (x) ´ f (a)) ¨
                                   lomonx ´ a
                      =T0(x)                                        =1
                                             f (x) ´ f (a)
         = T0(x) +              ¨(x ´ a)
                                   loooooomoooooonx ´ a

                                   looks familiar

     Indeed, this equation is important in the discussion that follows, so we’ll highlight it


