           the earth. See https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Integral_of_the_secant_function and
        https://arxiv.org/pdf/2204.11187.pdf. The method for evaluating the integral that is being
          presented in this example was invented by the Scottish mathematician James Gregory in 1668. There
           are also a number of other methods. See the previous two references.
