    and so is smaller than the nth term in the geometric series  n=0 2|x|n. This geometric
      series converges if |x| ă 1.  So, by the comparison test, our series converges for
       |x| ă 1 too.

39  Because of this, it might seem that such a series is fairly pointless. However there are all sorts of
