   To maximize x + y + 3z, imagine slowly increasing the value of C. As we do so, the
plane x + y + 3z = C moves to the right. We want to stop increasing C at the biggest value
of C for which the plane x + y + 3z = C intersects our surface x2 + 2y2 + 3z2 = 72. For
