    error introduced in making this approximation. The error En(∆t) is defined by
             g(t0 + ∆t) = g(t0) + g1(t0)∆t + 2!g2(t0)∆t21      + ¨ ¨ ¨ + n!g(n)(t0)∆tn1       + En(∆t)
   and obeys30
                           En(∆t) = (n+1)!g(n+1)(t01      + c∆t)∆tn+1
    for some (unknown) 0 ď c ď 1.
