    Theorem 2.9.16 (Second Derivative Test).

    Let r ą 0 and assume that all second order derivatives of the function f (x, y) are    continuous at all points (x, y) that are within a distance r of (a, b). Assume that
     fx(a, b) = fy(a, b) = 0. Define

