 Example 1.0.6 (Unparametrization of r(t) = (cos t, 7 ´ t))
In this example, we will undo the parametrization r(t) = (cos t, 7 ´ t) and find the Carte-
sian equation of the curve in question. We may rewrite the parametrization as

                                   x = cos t
                                   y = 7 ´ t

