2.9  The Rank Theorem


Objectives

   1. Learn to understand and use the rank theorem.

   2. Picture: the rank theorem.

   3. Theorem: rank theorem.

   4. Vocabulary words: rank, nullity.


   In this section we present the rank theorem, which is the culmination of all of
the work we have done so far.
   The reader may have observed a relationship between the column space and
the null space of a matrix. In this example in Section 2.6, the column space and
the null space of a 3 × 2 matrix are both lines, in R2 and R3, respectively:



