Example. Find the eigenvalues of the matrix

                                                     7  0  3
                      A =  −3  2 −3                          .
                             4  2  0


Solution. We compute the characteristic polynomial by expanding cofactors along
the ﬁrst row:

                                              7 −λ   0    3 
            f (λ) = det(A−λI3) = det  −3  2 −λ −3                            
                              4     2   −λ
