                 — vT —                                  m

By the row-column rule for matrix multiplication in Section 2.3, for any vector x
in Rn we have
                   vT                                  x    v1 · x                                           1
                                 vT                                  x        v2 · x                                          2                      Ax =                                                                                                                                                                                                             ...                                                  ...                    =     .
