  Recipe: Compute an orthogonal decomposition. Let W be a subspace of
  Rm. Here is a method to compute the orthogonal decomposition of a vector x
  with respect to W:

     1. Rewrite W as the column space of a matrix A. In other words, ﬁnd a a
