   Note that the exact value is 7/40 (do it with the Multiplication Rule). What is the probability of observing
red, green, and red, in no particular order?

> Prob(N, isin(N, c("red","green","red")))

[1] 0.525

  We already knew this. It is the probability of observing two red’s, above.

