the interval [0, 1], but for the sake of argument we will suppose that p falls strictly between zero and one.
How can we learn about the true value of p? Go ﬁshing! As before, we will use catch-and-release, but unlike
before, we will not tag the ﬁsh. We will simply note the species of any caught ﬁsh before returning it to the
pond.
