speed measurements, and at the moment, we are only interested in the subset of those speeds which occurred
during the ﬁrst experiment, that is, when the column Expt == 1. Note that the measurements are measured
in km/sec, and also note that the value 299,000 was subtracted from each observation in the dataset for clarity.
Now let us inspect a qqPlot:

[1] 14  2

   Judging by the graph in Figure 9.5, it is reasonable to suppose that the data are normally distributed.
