while trees with Tall = no will have the mean response

                                  µ(Girth) = β0 + β1Girth.                                (12.52)

In essence, we are ﬁtting two regression lines: one for tall trees, and one for short trees. The regression lines
have the same slope but they have diﬀerent y intercepts (which are exactly |β2| far apart).

