        medium 1 to medium 2 moves closer to the perpendicular when entering a medium with a higher index of refraction. (b) A ray of light
            traveling in the opposite direction, from medium 2 to medium 1, moves away from the perpendicular when entering a medium with a lower
           index of refraction.

