FIGURE 1.16 (a) An image “A” is transmitted by a bundle of optical fibers. (b) An endoscope is used to probe the body, both transmitting
light to the interior and returning an image such as the one shown of a human epiglottis (a structure at the base of the tongue). (credit b:
