    You may know Veronica Chambers (b. 1970) from having read Mama’sGirl, her 1996 memoir about being
     raised in Brooklyn by her mother, who had immigrated with her from Panama. You may have seen one of the
    many books that Chambers has coauthored, such as Yes,Chef with Marcus Samuelsson, published in 2013;
    MakeItMessy, also with Marcus Samuelsson, published in 2015; or Thirtytwo(32)Yolks, with Eric Ripert,
