INTRODUCTION You are likely familiar with the term proposal—people propose toasts to celebrate occasions
and make marriage proposals. Businesses create proposals to describe the services they will provide and at
what cost—from electricians, plumbers, and decorators to advertising firms, website designers, and caterers.
