In your analysis, note that objections could be raised because Peterson, for example, speaks only for himself.
You may speculate about whether the next edition of the newspaper will feature an opposing opinion piece
from someone who disagrees. However, it is not necessary to provide answers to questions you raise here. Your
conclusion should summarize briefly how the writer has made, or failed to make, a forceful argument that may
require further debate.

