            than 100,000 high school graduates, with proved ability, do not enter college because they cannot
              afford it. And if we cannot educate today’s youth, what will we do in 1970 when elementary school
            enrollment will be five million greater than 1960?”

        •  Visuals: graphs, photographs, charts, or maps used in addition to written or spoken information.





