         Transformation of the food production system faces resistance for a number of reasons, most of which dispute
         the need for plant-based diets. Historically, meat has been considered integral to athletes’ diets and thus has
         caused many consumers to believe meat is necessary for a healthy diet. Lynch et al. examined the impact of
