Once you have identified sources to fit both your and your readers’ needs, you can begin to locate these
sources. Throughout the research process, look for sources that will provide enough information for you to
form your own opinions or answer your research question(s). Use source materials as support for your own
words and ideas. The following are possible locations for source materials:
