    LEARNING OUTCOMES

    By the end of this section, you will be able to:
        •  Successfully apply citation conventions to your writing, understanding the ideas of intellectual property
          that motivate their use.
        •  Evaluate research materials for credibility, sufficiency, accuracy, timeliness, and bias.
        • Compose to discover and reconsider ideas.
