                  band
                          Noun: group of musicians

                              Verb: to move back and forth
                    rock
                          Noun: hard material found in the earth

                              Verb: to become sleepy or lose energy
                          tire
                          Noun: ring-shaped rubber component that fits over the wheel of a vehicle


