LEARNING OUTCOMES

By the end of this section, you will be able to:
  •  Read a diverse range of texts in different genres to identify how conventions are shaped by purpose,
    language, culture, and audience expectation.
  •  Read effectively for inquiry, learning, critical thinking, and communication in various rhetorical and
