18.5 Writing Process: Create a Multimodal Advocacy Project

LEARNING OUTCOMES

By the end of this section, you will be able to:
  •  Craft textual and digital compositions using various genres of modes and technologies.
  •  Match different modes of communication to various rhetorical situations.
  •  Identify various genres of multimodal and online writing.

Now you will experiment with using multiple modes to create an advocacy project. An advocacy project tells
the story of an overarching problem—for example, world hunger—and uses multiple modalities to inform
readers about that issue and to propose change. You may be familiar with similar advocacy projects; perhaps
