  •  Text, title, or description of post. Match the capitalization exactly, add quotation marks, and end with a
    period inside the closing quotation mark.
  •  Title of the social media site. Put the title of the site in italics, ending with a comma.
  •  Publication date and time. Give the day, month, year, and time of the post. Use the following abbreviations
     for months: Jan.,Feb.,Mar.,Apr.,Aug.,Sept.,Oct.,Nov., and Dec. Do not abbreviate May, June, and July.
  • URL. Give the URL, without “http://.”

