     Suicidal thoughts, plans, and even off-hand remarks (“I might kill myself this afternoon”) should always be
     taken extremely seriously. People who contemplate terminating their life need immediate help. Below is a link
     to an excellent website that contains resources (including hotlines) for people who are struggling with suicidal
     ideation, have loved ones who may be suicidal, or who have lost loved ones to suicide: http://www.afsp.org. In
