years due to cost-of-living increases. At the same time, increasingly more people are using email, text, and
other digital message forms such as Facebook and Twitter to communicate with friends and others. What does
this suggest about the continued viability of the Postal Service? Figure 3.18 and the text below illustrate this
using the four-step analysis to answer this question.





