 value might drop as low as 100 or even less. Calculate the HHI for an industry with 100 firms that each have 1%
  of the market. In this case, the HHI is 100(12) = 100.
 Step 3. Calculate the HHI for the industry in Table 11.1. In this case, the HHI is 162 + 102 + 82 + 7(62) + 8(32) =
