permits allow the firms to emit only half as much pollution. Let’s say that in a year, Firm Gamma finds it easy
and cheap to reduce emissions from 600 tons of lead to 200 tons, which means that it has permits that it is not
using that allow emitting 100 tons of lead. Firm Beta reduces its lead pollution from 400 tons to 200 tons, so it
