     purchases $20 million in bonds from Happy Bank, the bond holdings of Happy Bank fall by $20 million and the
     bank’s reserves rise by $20 million. However, Happy Bank only wants to hold $40 million in reserves, so the
    bank decides to loan out the extra $20 million in reserves and its loans rise by $20 million. The central bank''s
    open market operation causes Happy Bank to make loans instead of holding its assets in the form of




